Third-party material in this crate
=================================

The MJCF importer in `src/mjcf/` ports rules and arithmetic from MuJoCo and is a
derivative work of Apache-2.0 code. The licence is the file LICENSE-MuJoCo next to
this one (the file `LICENSE` of the MuJoCo source tree, copied unmodified). Each
Rust function or module that ports MuJoCo code names its origin, file and lines.

