From the MuJoCo tree at commit a8373cc4ee51a2fe1c9e664401b8b8150647becf (the
compiler, the XML reader and the renderer; the 3.14.0 source tree used by
crates/sim-physics does not contain them):

  src/user/user_objects.cc
                         mjCBody::Compile, mjCBody::InertiaFromGeom,
                         mjCGeom::Compile, mjCGeom::GetVolume, mjCGeom::GetRBound,
                         mjCJoint::Compile, mjCActuator::Compile,
                         mjCTendon::Compile, mjCSite::Compile, mjCCamera::Compile,
                         mjCCamera::ResolveReferences, checksize, checklimited,
                         ResolveOrientation
  src/user/user_util.cc  the mjuu_ helpers: normvec, quat2mat, mulquat,
                         mulvecmat, mulmat, mulRMRT, transposemat, crossvec, dot3,
                         z2quat, frame2quat, frameaccum, globalinertia, offcenter,
                         eig3, fullInertia
  src/user/user_mesh.cc  triangle, ComputeFaceCentroid, ComputeVolume,
                         ComputeInertia, ApplyTransformations (scale), the tail of
                         Process (winding correction, centre of mass, principal
                         axes, inertia box) and Rotate (the box of the vertices in
                         the principal frame)
  src/user/user_model.cc the order in which the document's <statistic> values
                         override the computed model statistic
  src/user/user_init.c   mjs_defaultCamera, mjs_defaultSite (defaults)
  src/xml/xml_native_reader.cc
                         the section order of mjXReader::Parse, mjXReader::Default,
                         the class resolution of mjXReader::Body, OneCamera,
                         OneSite, Statistic, Visual
  src/xml/xml_base.cc    ReadAlternative
  src/xml/xml_util.cc    ReadAttr (the number reader)
  src/xml/mjcf.schema and src/xml/generated/mjcf_read_table.inc
                         the attribute tables (which attributes an element has,
                         which a <default> may not set, `exclusive fovy sensorsize`)
  src/render/classic/render_gl3.c, render_util.c
                         setView and mjr_lookAt: the projection the renderer builds
                         from a camera's frustum, which the scene camera's
                         intrinsics reproduce (read, not copied: the importer
                         derives fx, fy, cx, cy from it in closed form)
  plugin/stl_decoder/stl_decoder.cc
                         the binary STL decoder

From MuJoCo 3.14.0 (the oracle's version; src/engine/ of that tree):

  engine_setconst.c      setStat (the model's bounding box, extent and mean body
                         size), updateBox, setSameframe with isNullVec3,
                         isNullQuat, isSameQuat, isSameVec3 (kSameFrameEps)
  engine_core_smooth.c   mj_kinematics at qpos0 (as ported by crates/sim-physics,
                         src/smooth.rs), for setStat
  engine_core_util.c     mj_local2Global (positions)
  engine_vis_visualize.c mjv_cameraFrustum and getFrustum (the camera frustum and
                         clip planes), the resolution test of the camera frustum
                         decoration
  engine_init.c          mj_defaultStatistic, the visual defaults (znear, zfar,
                         offwidth, offheight)
  engine_inline.h, engine_util_blas.c, engine_util_spatial.c, engine_util_misc.c
                         mji_mulMatVec3, mji_rotVecQuat, mji_mulQuat, mju_quat2Mat,
                         mju_normalize4, mju_dist3, mju_max (and mjMIN, mjMAX of
                         include/mujoco/mjmacro.h)

The test fixtures in tests/fixtures/mujoco/ carry their own NOTICE.
